          "#### Replication packages at ICPSR",
          "The paper's replication package is at ICPSR (openICPSR, which holds the AEA Data and Code Repository). We list it, but cannot check its files: ICPSR's site does not allow automatic downloads.",
          "\n```{r}\n#| echo: false\n\n\n# table data --------------------------------------\ntable <- structure(list(Deposit = \"<a href='https://doi.org/10.3886/E195681V1' target='_blank'>10.3886/E195681V1<\/a>\", \n    Title = NA_character_, Published = NA_character_), row.names = c(NA, \n-1L), class = \"data.frame\")\n\n# display table -----------------------------------\nmetacheck::report_table(table, \"auto\", 10, FALSE)\n```\n",
